data: {"id": "9f076281b48247e3-thinking-parallel_evidence-946", "run_id": "9f076281b48247e3", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n1. **Pod 当前状态**：`aiops-case-v07/workload` 处于 **Pending**，phase=Pending，container `app` 的 state=Waiting, reason=`ImagePullBackOff`，restarts=0。异常**仍在持续**，未恢复。\n\n2. **镜像引用（YAML）**：`image: registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908`，`imagePullPolicy: Always`，`imagePullSecrets: <absent>`。镜像名称格式合法（符合 `<registry>/<namespace>/<image>:<tag>` 规范），排除格式错误。\n\n3. **Events 关键错误原文**（17m 前首次，19m 时间窗内）：\n   - `Failed to pull image ... : rpc error: code = No", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789442285376, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

