data: {"id": "9f076281b48247e3-final", "run_id": "9f076281b48247e3", "seq": 951, "ts_ms": 1789442301864, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-v07/workload` | ImagePullBackOff | aiops-case-v07/workload 处于 ImagePullBackOff 状态，Pod 无法启动 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | kubernetes | `pod.phase = Pending` | 确认 Pod 处于不可用状态 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | kubernetes | `Failed to pull image ... rpc error: code = NotFound desc = failed to resolve reference \"registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause:aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908\"` | 直接证实镜像拉取因目标 Tag 不存在而失败 |\n| 3 | K8s State | kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason = ImagePullBackOff` | 反映 kubelet 正在指数退避重试拉取失败镜像 |\n| 4 | Metric | prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason{reason=\"ImagePullBackOff\"} = 1` | 从监控侧证实 Pod 容器正处于镜像拉取失败等待状态 |\n\n**证据关系说明：**\nKubernetes 事件（证据 2）提供了具体的镜像仓库 404 错误细节，直接解释了 K8s 状态（证据 3）中 `ImagePullBackOff` 的成因；Prometheus 指标（证据 4）独立印证了 K8s 中观察到的状态异常。日志与链路追踪因容器未启动而不适用。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n镜像 tag 'aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908' 不存在 → 容器运行时拉取镜像返回 NotFound 错误 → Pod 状态转为 ImagePullBackOff 并停止重试 → 应用服务不可用\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为：Pod 配置引用的镜像 tag `aiops-fixture-unavailable-20260908` 在指定仓库 `registry.cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com/google_containers/pause` 中不存在。\n- 故障机制：容器运行时尝试拉取该镜像时收到 `NotFound` 错误（证据 2）。\n- 故障表现：Kubelet 进入 `ImagePullBackOff` 等待状态（证据 3），导致 Pod 无法调度为 `Running`，应用不可用（证据 1, 4）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.0m\n├─ 问题定位: 15.7s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 39.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-v07/workload: 39.4s (Evidence 30.7s, RCA 8.6s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.7s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-v07/workload**: pod-imagepull-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 62.765, "metrics": {"run_id": "9f076281b48247e3", "mttr": {"value": "1.0m", "seconds": 62.77297616004944, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-imagepull-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-imagepull-failed"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 62772.97616004944, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 58153.21111679077, "tool_calls": 14, "executed_tool_calls": 11, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 2, "successful_tool_calls": 11, "failed_tool_calls": 3, "tool_duration_ms": 11912.007570266724, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 4272.320508956909}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 15663.750648498535, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 39416.67175292969, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusio